# An allowlist, not a denylist. The image copies exactly two things — a built `dist/` and one
# nginx conf — so everything else is context the daemon uploads for nothing. `node_modules` alone
# is a few hundred MB, and `.cra-backup` is a second whole scaffold.
#
# `*` does not cross `/`, so re-including `dist` re-includes everything under it.
*
!dist
!deploy-nginx.conf
